@pass no house floor in the sea-level water layer (`base water 0` on every kept village); `water-below` under houses `max` 2 or less; pruned wet houses (log `pruned K of N`) are not in the world: the probe's `pieces` equals N minus K
@fails a house in the water: pruning kept a piece under `pruneMinWetColumns` 16; record its water columns
